@startuml
[*] --> Unregistered
Unregistered --> Registering : Request Registration
Registering --> Validating : Submit Registration Details
Validating --> Unregistered : Registration Failed
Validating --> LoggedIn : Registration Successful
LoggedIn --> CheckingTicketStatus : Request Ticket Status
LoggedIn --> BookingTicket : Request Book Ticket
LoggedIn --> ManagingAccount : Request Manage Account
CheckingTicketStatus --> LoggedIn : Display Ticket Status
BookingTicket --> ConfirmingTicket : Initiate Booking
ConfirmingTicket --> Paying : Confirm Booking
Paying --> LoggedIn : Payment Successful
Paying --> ConfirmingTicket : Payment Failed
ManagingAccount --> LoggedIn : Account Managed
LoggedIn --> Unregistered : Request Logout
@enduml
